    "text": "Tonawanda\nNYSDEC to commence Huntley Power Plant site cleanup this summer in Tonawanda\n9 hours ago\nTONAWANDA TOWN, N.Y. — The New York State Department of Environmental Conservation (NYSDEC) has announced cleanup plans for the site of the former Huntley Power Plant in the Town of Tonawanda. Work on the site is expected to begin in July or August, with completion of the cleanup expected...",
